## `print_unused_assms`

``` hol4
Refute.print_unused_assms : config option -> string option -> unit
```

Prints unused-assumption information, with one-based indexes and the
number of inconclusive probes, for the named theory or for the current
theory given `NONE`.
See [`Refute.find_unused_assms`](#Refute.find_unused_assms).
